rt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Then, we take the absolute value of the squared quantity and simplify using the rules of absolute value:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"21\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 8.597em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.45em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c210E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D458 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.289em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: le